   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of a bilateral cooperation project between the Swedish and Albanian Police agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective and desired outcome of the contribution is to improve capability and increased professionalism of the ASP in responding to and managing SGBV cases, as well as improve quality in criminal investigations, based on robust technical evidence. This would result in Enhanced capacity and effectiveness of the ASP to comply with international best practices and human rights standards.</narrative>
